---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config.mjs';
---
<Base title="Start Here: A Lean Path to Your First Online Income"
  description="New to building an online creator business? A simple four-step path, and the free tools to start each step.">
  <p class="kicker">Start here</p>
  <h1>A lean path to your first online income</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">{site.name} is for people who want to start an online creator business (selling ebooks, templates, courses or a newsletter) without spending a lot on software first. This is the path we recommend, in order.</p>

  <ol class="steps">
    <li><h2>Decide what you'll offer</h2><p>Start with one small digital product you can finish in a week: a checklist, a template, a short guide. You'll learn more from selling one small thing than from planning a big one.</p></li>
    <li><h2>Start an email list on day one</h2><p>Social platforms can change their reach overnight; an email list is the audience you own. Several email tools have free plans that are enough for your first hundreds of subscribers. See <a href="/free-plans/">free plans compared</a>.</p></li>
    <li><h2>Pick one place to sell</h2><p>You don't need a custom website to sell your first product. All-in-one platforms let you build a sales page, take payments and deliver the product. Choose one and stick with it until you've made your first sales.</p></li>
    <li><h2>Bring in visitors without ads</h2><p>Pinterest and search engines can send visitors for months after you publish, because people search them for solutions. Write helpful posts about the problem your product solves, and link to your product from them.</p></li>
  </ol>

  <h2>What to read next</h2>
  <ul class="list-links">
    <li><a href="/free-plans/">Free plans compared: creator tools you can start with for $0 →</a></li>
    <li><a href="/tools/">All tools by category →</a></li>
    <li><a href="/guides/">Guides →</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
